---
/**
 * StakesSection — what they lose by going elsewhere. SB7: Failure.
 */
---

<section class="section bg-cumberland-ink text-cumberland-cream">
  <div class="container-rail max-w-4xl">
    <p class="eyebrow text-cumberland-stone">What you risk by going somewhere else</p>
    <h2 class="mt-4">Same money. Worse work. Worse week.</h2>

    <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="text-cumberland-stone shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>
        Game day with shirts that didn't ship.
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="text-cumberland-stone shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>
        A storefront sign that blends into every other strip mall.
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="text-cumberland-stone shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>
        A wrapped vehicle in the wrong shade of your brand color.
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="text-cumberland-stone shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>
        A church youth event without the t-shirts the kids were promised.
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="text-cumberland-stone shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>
        The exact same money — for noticeably worse work.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mt-10 text-xl text-cumberland-mist">
      Your team, your business, your church deserves better than a tracking
      number from a stranger.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
